--- Honest risk ---
This is a floor-preserving move with one surgical matchup gain, not a ceiling-breaker: vs
non-counter decks v9 is byte-behavior-identical to the proven v8 (759.8 live). Expected live
effect: recovers a slice of the largest loss bucket (PH family, 45% of losses; local arm 5->14%
vs an elite PH pilot; ladder PH pilots are weaker, so the recovered slice may be larger).
Residual known losses (structural, no rules lever found): Hariyama Wild Press 210 + Mega
Lucario Dwebble-farming (b950-style, ~35%), Mega Starmie Nebula Beam 210 pierce, elite PH
hands that hammer the Mist off. Beating ~890 requires more than the wall can give.
